  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 7007.11 Failure to File. A local exchange telecommunication service provider, other telecommunication service provider and sellers of prepaid commercial mobile radio service shall be assessed overdue surcharge amounts for past due amounts at any time.\n\nSource. #9091, eff 2-21-08 (See Revision Note at Chapter Heading for Saf-C 7000); amd by #11010, INTERIM, eff 1-1-16, EXPIRES: 6-29-16 (from Saf-C 7007.09); ss by #11128, eff 6-29-16",
